# Button

Developer implementation reference for the NEXUS Button component.

## HTML

<Source
  language="html"
  code={`<button class="nexus-button nexus-button--primary nexus-button--contained nexus-button--large">
  <span class="nexus-button__label">Large</span>
</button>`}
/>

## CSS

<Source
  language="css"
  code={`/* NEXUS Button CSS */
.nexus-button {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.nexus-button--primary {
  background: #2453d4;
  color: #ffffff;
}

.nexus-button--contained {
  border: none;
}

.nexus-button--large {
  min-height: 44px;
  padding: 0 24px;
  font-size: 16px;
}

.nexus-button--medium {
  min-height: 40px;
  padding: 0 20px;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.nexus-button--small {
  min-height: 36px;
  padding: 0 16px;
  font-size: 13px;
}`}
/>
